+
+## Independent classification judgment
+
+For each row below, the `source_rule_id` is `rule-<normalized SHA-256>`.
+All rules are in module `VERIFICATION`.
+
+| Span | Normalized SHA-256 | Attributes | Independent class | Judgment |
